{% assign litter = all_products['automatic-smart-cat-litter-box'] %}
{% assign feeder = all_products['automatic-pet-feeder-with-camera'] %}
<section class="home-hero">
  <div class="home-hero__copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">SMART PET CARE / 01</p>
    <h1>Designed for<br><em>living well.</em></h1>
    <p class="lede">Thoughtful technology for the everyday moments that matter — feeding, cleaning and caring for the pets you love.</p>
    <a class="link-button" href="#shop">Shop the collection <span>↗</span></a>
  </div>
  <a class="home-hero__media" href="{{ litter.url }}">
    {% if litter.featured_image %}{{ litter.featured_image | image_url: width:1400 | image_tag: loading:'eager', widths:'600,900,1200,1400', sizes:'(max-width:800px) 100vw, 58vw', alt:litter.title }}{% endif %}
    <span class="image-note">01 / AUTOMATIC LITTER SYSTEM <b>{{ litter.price | money }}</b></span>
  </a>
</section>

<section class="intro-strip"><p>Smart products.</p><p>Quiet design.</p><p>Less daily work.</p><p>More time together.</p></section>

<section class="collection-section" id="shop">
  <div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE COLLECTION</p><h2>Everyday essentials.</h2></div><a href="/collections/all" class="quiet-link">View all products <span>→</span></a></div>
  <div class="product-grid">
    {% for product in collections.all.products limit:6 %}
      <article class="product-card">
        <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="product-card__media">
          {% if product.featured_image %}{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width:1100 | image_tag: loading:'lazy', widths:'450,700,900,1100', sizes:'(max-width:700px) 92vw, (max-width:1000px) 46vw, 31vw', alt:product.title }}{% endif %}
          <span class="product-card__view">View product</span>
        </a>
        <div class="product-card__details"><div><a href="{{ product.url }}">{{ product.title }}</a><small>{{ product.type | default:'Smart pet care' }}</small></div><strong>{{ product.price | money }}</strong></div>
        {% assign rating = product.metafields.reviews.rating.value.rating %}{% assign count = product.metafields.reviews.rating_count.value %}
        {% if count and count > 0 %}<div class="product-rating"><span>★★★★★</span> {{ rating | round:1 }} · {{ count }} reviews</div>{% endif %}
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="editorial">
  <div class="editorial__media">{% if feeder.featured_image %}{{ feeder.featured_image | image_url: width:1300 | image_tag: loading:'lazy', widths:'600,900,1100,1300', sizes:'(max-width:800px) 100vw, 56vw', alt:feeder.title }}{% endif %}</div>
  <div class="editorial__copy"><p class="eyebrow">CONNECTED CARE / 02</p><h2>Technology that<br><em>stays out of the way.</em></h2><p>Automatic routines should feel simple. Our smart essentials are designed to work quietly in the background while your home stays yours.</p><a class="quiet-link" href="{{ feeder.url }}">Discover the smart feeder <span>→</span></a></div>
</section>

<section class="color-story"><div class="color-story__copy"><p class="eyebrow">THE HAFHAFHAF STANDARD</p><h2>Good design<br>should feel <em>obvious.</em></h2><p>We choose useful technology, clean forms and materials that belong in a modern home. Nothing unnecessary.</p></div><div class="color-story__blocks"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div></section>

<section class="review-section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">CUSTOMER REVIEWS</p><h2>Real people.<br>Real routines.</h2></div><p class="review-note">Only genuine review data is shown here. Connect your review provider to populate this section.</p></div><div class="review-cards"><article><span>★★★★★</span><p>Verified customer reviews will appear here automatically.</p><small>REAL CUSTOMER PROOF</small></article><article><span>★★★★★</span><p>We don't manufacture ratings or testimonials to make the store look bigger.</p><small>HAFHAFHAF STANDARD</small></article><article><span>★★★★★</span><p>Every product page is ready for your genuine review content.</p><small>PRODUCT REVIEWS</small></article></div></section>

<section class="newsletter"><p class="eyebrow">STAY IN THE LOOP</p><h2>Good things for<br><em>good companions.</em></h2>{% form 'customer' %}<input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="newsletter"><div class="newsletter__form"><input type="email" name="contact[email]" placeholder="Your email address" required><button type="submit">Subscribe <span>→</span></button></div>{% endform %}</section>
{% schema %}{"name":"HafHafHaf Home","settings":[],"presets":[{"name":"HafHafHaf Home"}]}{% endschema %}